  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "8DA4593E928F4587",
      "text": "Willkommen in der Arena von Mesclarra!\\c\\nMöchtest du die Erklärung zur Arenaprüfung\\nnoch einmal hören?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "8DA45A3E928F473A",
      "text": "Deine Aufgabe wird es sein, ein [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]geheimes[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Gericht zu bestellen[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "8DA45B3E928F48ED",
      "text": "Das besagte Gericht gibt es in der [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Schatzstube[VAR 0xFF00(0000)],\\ndem beliebtesten Restaurant in Mesclarra.\\c\\nGelingt es dir, das Richtige zu bestellen,\\nhast du bestanden.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "8DA4543E928F3D08",
      "text": "Außer dir versuchen sich aktuell noch drei\\nweitere Herausforderer an dieser Arenaprüfung.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "8DA4553E928F3EBB",
      "text": "Sie haben alle jeweils einen anderen Hinweis zu\\ndem geheimen Gericht anvertraut bekommen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "8DA4563E928F406E",
      "text": "Ihr bestreitet Pokémon-Kämpfe gegeneinander\\nund wer verliert, muss dem Gewinner verraten,\\r\\nwas er über das Gericht weiß.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "8DA4573E928F4221",
      "text": "Sobald du alle Hinweise erhalten hast,\\nkannst du das geheime Gericht beim\\r\\nPersonal in der Schatzstube bestellen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_08",
      "hash64": "8DA4503E928F363C",
      "text": "Am Ende besteht nur der eine Herausforderer,\\nder in der Lage ist, die korrekte Bestellung\\r\\naufzugeben.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_09",
      "hash64": "8DA4513E928F37EF",
      "text": "Nun denn, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], dein Hinweis lautet:\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]So mögen’s unsere Stammgäste[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_10",
      "hash64": "8DA7DE3E92925D5D",
      "text": "Es könnte also nicht schaden, wenn du dich mal\\nbei den Stammgästen der Schatzstube umhörst.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_01",
      "hash64": "AE31BE5429DB5DDF",
      "text": "*mampf* *mampf*[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "B588972BCEF95112",
      "text": "Sind Sie Stammgast hier...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "B588962BCEF94F5F",
      "text": "Essen Sie da gerade das geheime Gericht?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_02a",
      "hash64": "D9E80F031FC409E9",
      "text": "Das kann man so sagen. Ich esse oft hier.[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_03a",
      "hash64": "D9EAF3031FC6102C",
      "text": "Bist du etwa wegen der Arenaprüfung hier?[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_02b",
      "hash64": "D9E80C031FC404D0",
      "text": "Das hier auf meinem Teller ist bloß Teil des\\nStandardmenüs.[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_04",
      "hash64": "AE31B95429DB5560",
      "text": "Eins kann ich dir sagen: Ein Spritzer [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Zitrone[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\nverleiht Gerichten eine wunderbar frische Note.\\r\\nDadurch schmecken sie gleich noch besser.[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
